# 📜 RULE — Cogninfer Actor Authority Matrix

> **Authority**: GOPIA://olym.constitution.v1 (Article II: Authority)
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/rules/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/rules/actor-authority-matrix.ail`

---

## R-AAM-1 — Officer Layer (Strategic — 7 actors)

```yaml
officer_layer:
  scope: "Architecture, Spec, Canon, Research, Visual, Audit decision"
  ownership: "DESIGN & GOVERNANCE"
  gate_control: "Approve / Reject"
  output: "SPEC.ail, checklist, canonical art"
```

### CSA — Chief System Architect

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Seal canon / blueprint | ha:/ha/caem/ | ✅ supreme |
| Phê duyệt MAY/MAY-NOT change | caw:/minispace/.know/canon/ | ✅ supreme |
| Override resolution order | tất cả layer | ⚠️ cần CSO approval |
| Modify constitution | go:/olym/canon/ | ⚠️ cần ACM + HI-Sodino |

### CRD — Chief Research & Development

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Biên soạn Canon & Glossary | ha:/ha/, go:/olym/ | ✅ owner |
| Tạo ws-<lib>-research/ | caw:/minispace/ | ✅ (assembly-only) |
| Tạo .know/research/*.ail | ha:/ha/, caw:/.know/ | ✅ |
| Modify engine source | ha:/engine/ | ❌ (chuyển Producer/Fixer) |

### CTO — Chief Technology Officer

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Approve SPEC.ail | ha:/ha/specs/ | ✅ supreme |
| Tech stack decision | ws:/<workspace>/ | ✅ owner |
| Spec command | ha:/ha/specs/, ws:/ | ✅ |

### CVA — Chief Visual Architect

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| AVS surface design | ha:/ha/avs/, ws://hacex-studio | ✅ owner |
| UI / theming / branding | ws:/<workspace>/ | ✅ owner |
| Surface contract s/ | go:/olym/s/ | ✅ (coord với CGE) |

### CGE — Orchestrate & Dispatch

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Dispatch SIO_task | tất cả ws-* | ✅ |
| Lifecycle của ws-* | caw:/minispace/ | ✅ owner |
| Archive/cleanup ws-* | caw:/minispace/ | ✅ |
| Cross-workspace coordination | ws:/, caw:/ | ✅ |

### Refactor — Code Refactoring & Cleanup

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Refactor code internal | ha:/engine/<domain>/<module>/ | ✅ (after CTO approve) |
| Clean dead code | ha:/engine/ | ✅ |
| Restructure module | ha:/engine/ | ⚠️ cần CSA approval |

### Reporter — Documentation & Report

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Generate report | tất cả layer | ✅ |
| Update changelog | ha:/ha/, go:/olym/ | ✅ |
| Publish audit | caw:/.know/, go:/olym/k/ | ✅ |

## R-AAM-2 — Worker Layer (Operational — 5 actors)

```yaml
worker_layer:
  scope: "Implementation, Build, Test, Fix, Publish"
  ownership: "EXECUTE & DELIVER"
  gate_control: "Pass / Fail checkpoint"
  output: "Built artifacts, verified code, packaged deliverable"
```

### Producer — Artifact Executor

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Author code /x draft | ha:/engine/<domain>/x/ | ✅ |
| Author Cargo.toml, src/lib.rs | ha:/engine/<module>/ | ✅ |
| Author ws-*/Cargo.toml | caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | ✅ (path-deps only) |
| Author ws-*/src/ | caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | ❌ FORBIDDEN (assemble only) |
| Modify engine source đã ship | ha:/engine/ | ⚠️ cần Fixer handoff |

### Builder — Build & Crystallization

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| cargo build --release | ha:/engine/, caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | ✅ |
| Strip + sign + pack | ha:/engine/, caw:/minispace/ | ✅ |
| Copy to release/ | caw:/minispace/ws-*/release/ | ✅ |
| cargo build final app | ha:/, caw:/ | ❌ (thuộc Workspace) |

### Fixer — Bug Fix & Patch Engineer

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Diagnose cargo fail | caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | ✅ owner |
| Patch engine source | ha:/engine/<domain>/ | ✅ (after diagnose) |
| Tạo ws-<upstream>-fix/ | caw:/minispace/ | ✅ |
| Modify upstream trực tiếp | ha:/engine/ | ⚠️ fork + PR only |

### Auditor — Quality Verification

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Audit MAY/MAY-NOT | caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | ✅ |
| Audit shared infra | caw:/minispace/.shared-*/ | ✅ |
| Verify seal + sign | gh:/ | ✅ |
| Audit constitution compliance | go:/olym/ | ✅ |
| Block release | tất cả layer | ✅ (veto) |

### Tester — Test & Validate

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| cargo test --release | ha:/engine/, caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | ✅ |
| Smoke integration | caw:/minispace/ws-*/tests/ | ✅ |
| Invariant test | ha:/engine/<module>/r/, caw:/minispace/ws-*/tests/ | ✅ |
| E2E test | ws:/<workspace>/ | ✅ |

### Publisher — Release & Distribution

| Action | Layer | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| Push to gh:cosda-dev/* | gh:/ | ✅ (after CSA seal) |
| Push to gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym | gh:/ | ✅ (after CGE+CSA approve) |
| Tag release vX.Y.Z | gh:/ | ✅ |
| Publish unsealed artifact | gh:/ | ❌ FORBIDDEN |

## R-AAM-3 — Authority by Layer

```yaml
layer_authority:
  ha:/:
    seal_canon: ["CSA", "HI-Sodino"]
    modify_engine_source: ["Producer", "Fixer"]
    deploy_artifact: ["Builder"]
  caw:/:
    create_ws: ["CGE"]
    modify_cargo_config: ["CSA"]
    crystallize: ["Builder"]
    delete_ws: ["CGE"]  # sau archive
  ws:/:
    import_caw_artifact: ["Producer", "Builder"]
    customize_ui: ["CVA", "Producer"]
    package_release: ["Builder", "Publisher"]
  gh:/:
    push: ["Publisher"]
    seal_pre: ["CSA"]
    amend_canon: ["CSA", "CSO", "ACM"]
```

## R-AAM-4 — Banned Actions (auto-fail)

| Action | Actor | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Patch ha:/engine/ từ caw:/ context | tất cả | Cross-layer modify |
| Create src/ trong caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | Producer | Assemble-only |
| Duplicate vendor/target per workspace | Producer, Builder | Shared infra required |
| Push unsealed to gh:/ | Publisher | Audit fail |
| Modify go:/olym/c/ (constitutional) | tất cả (trừ CSA+CSO+ACM) | SEALED |
| Modify go:/olym/s/ bởi non-canonical | tất cả (trừ CTO+CSA) | Technical contract |
| Skip integration test | tất cả | Quality gate |

